+# Contract: area stores, keyword search
+
+## Source
+
+area: store keyword search
+
+## Scope
+
+- Searching stores by a keyword that matches no store returns an empty list.
+- Searching stores by the exact name of one store returns that store and no other.
+
+## Out of scope
+
+- Store creation and deletion: covered by the existing store specs.
+
+## Cases
+
+| Case | Technique | Project | Data role | Oracle |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| C1 a keyword that matches no store returns an empty list | negative | restapi | store administrator | schema: POST /api/stores/search with a keyword returns only the stores that match it |
+| C2 the exact name of one store returns exactly that store | equivalence partitioning | restapi | store administrator | schema: POST /api/stores/search with a keyword returns only the stores that match it |
+
+## Stand needs
+
+- Profile: the evaluation stand
+- Modules and flags: VirtoCommerce.Store
+- Data roles: store administrator
+
+## Building blocks
+
+- Reuse: `api.rest.stores.search`, `arrange.platform.store()`
+- Add: one spec under `tests/restapi/store/`
+
+## Known issues
+
+- None
+
+## Verification
+
+- `npm run typecheck`, `npm run check`, then `npm run test:restapi -- tests/restapi/store/<new spec>`
